# Icon redraw, 2026-10-26: cog, wheat sheaf, hammer.
# Replaces icon-cog, icon-wheat and icon-hammer, which read as a ring, a key and a scythe.
# Research notes: ../README.md

# Settings. Eight evenly spaced square teeth, a dark center hole, bevel lit from the upper left.
